  "Title": "ELSA-2026-50828:  ruby:3.3 security, bug fix, and enhancement update (IMPORTANT)",
  "Description": "ruby\n[3.3.12-8]\n- Upgrade to Ruby 3.3.12.\n  Resolves: RHEL-171335\n  Resolves: RHEL-193665\n\nrubygem-mysql2\n[0.5.5-3]\n- Disable tests on the 32bit platforms ix86.\n  Related: RHEL-80222\n\n[0.5.5-2]\n- Adapt tests to openssl 3.2\n  Resolves: RHEL-80222\n\n[0.5.5-1]\n- Upgrade to mysql2 0.5.5.\n  Related: RHEL-17089\n\nrubygem-pg\n[-1.5.4-2]\n- Fix encoding issue in spec suite.\n  Resolves: RHEL-159199",
